    "title": "Kingman Little League celebrates season finale, announces 2026 All-Star Team - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Allen Scott ,\n13 hours ago KINGMAN — The Kingman Little League capped its season with a lively year‑end awards ceremony, highlighted by the announcement of the 2026 All‑Star team that will represent the league in the upcoming District 9 Tournament. Kingman will host the tournament this year at Southside Park from June 26 through July 3. Read full article\n1",
